    <string name="ai_device_agent_stage6_title">Stage 6 direct data capabilities</string>
    <string name="ai_device_agent_stage6_description">Each category is granted separately and limited to the current task and one explicit target. Every operation still requires approval. Read notification, SMS, contact, calendar, media and sensor content is sent to your configured AI provider, which may retain requests under its policies. The device-agent switch does not grant these capabilities.</string>
